      "date": "2026-05-16T19:52:33.000Z",
      "title": "Final dividend increased to ₹4.00",
      "body": "Dividend of ₹4.00 is 33% higher than last year. Ex-date: 29th May 2026 Payment date: 13th June 2026 Dividend yield will be 0.4%, which is lower than the industry average of 0.8%. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is well covered by both earnings (4% earnings payout ratio) and cash flows (17% cash payout ratio). The dividend has increased by an average of 20% per year over the past 10 years and has been stable with no material reductions to payments, indicating a long track record of dividend growth and stability. EPS is expected to grow by 30% over the next 2 years, which should provide support to the dividend and adequate earnings cover.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
    {
